<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fleetwood Enterprises.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fleetwood Enterprises.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs cut its rating on Fleetwood Enterprises Inc to market underperform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 at 29-1/4.</p>
</text>
